frequenz (0.2.1-1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * New application icon (hicolor PNGs from 16 to 512 px) and AppStream metadata,
    so GNOME Software and KDE Discover list the app.
  * Fedora, Debian and Flatpak packaging now live in one tree.
  * Review fixes: malformed place rows no longer abort a sync, a failed batch write
    no longer aborts the run, incremental sync notices changed places, a corrupt
    catalog is reported by 'frequenz doctor', Ctrl+Q runs the full teardown, and
    missing MP3/AAC decoders are reported per format.

 -- Pablo Magana <pablo@laps.se>  Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:30:00 +0100

